{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-08_end","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-08","title":"黃昏","storyCode":"3-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-08_end.txt","sourceHash":"e3f45b137818047d03e1dd32011f5c644f555f29032f86ba1d0147abbf9e879f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"“碎骨”再次倒下，但沒有人露出笑容。陳沒有安慰阿米婭，只是難得吐露了一些心聲。\n帶著各種各樣的思緒，眾人踏上歸途。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"已經結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_0_coma"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"人總是會超出預期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感染者更會如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"力量使人瘋狂，欲望使人墮落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"像癌症一樣，一點點侵蝕著所有美好的事物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對你來說，這面具什麼意義都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想留著，就留著吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"總有一天，這種面具會堆滿你的房間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都要為他們的選擇承擔後果。感染者與否，都沒有區別。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陳警官......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"聽著，阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動，這些人，如果他們願意傾聽你的話語，你可以盡你所能幫助他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果他們拒絕聽取任何聲音，只想把餘下的所有生命獻給瘋狂......不要再猶豫了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"她也並沒有作惡。並且，這也不是什麼罪惡的下場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"僅僅是因為她選擇了這個結果而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"沒人有資格去阻止她，沒有人有資格去責怪她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我......."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道......一直以來，我都覺得我們有一種責任，去幫助應該幫助的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，為什麼......最後會變成這樣。為什麼她需要去一個人承擔這樣的後果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島所做的事情，真的是正確的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"從感染了礦石病開始，人的命運就不再是由他一個人掌握的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"也許在羅德島看來，誤入歧途還是可以被拯救的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但是對我而言，對近衛局而言，卻並非如此。可能，在必要的時候，必須......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想去改變那種永無止境的狀況......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是一點點，一點點——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......這一切如果最後只能變成這樣的結局，那我只能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你動搖了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者不是被敵意溺死，就是自己走向毀滅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"悲劇只會一次接一次的重演。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"在這苦恨的迴圈裡，除了消滅礦石病之外，還有一種方法可以讓感染者重拾希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就是，熄滅這根荊棘鎖鏈上的仇恨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"給予仁慈是需要付出足夠的代價的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島永遠也不會變成近衛局這樣，也做不到近衛局那樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你們羅德島願意接納多少感染者，妄想透過柔軟的手法拯救多少人————那都是羅德島才能做，或者說————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島才會做的事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，這樣的事情，我不能做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局————更加不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......至少，除了他的同胞以外，還有你會去留下他的面具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果這樣的面具，註定會堆滿你的房間，那就讓他堆吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"記住，這是你的事，不是別人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——羅德島的小小的“領導人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你已經真的做好了心理準備去背負這一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"做出你的選擇，承擔你選擇的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陳長官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局在清掃現場之後會進行修整，之後，我會聯繫那個醫生的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，看來人的命運總是交織在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"互相牽絆，互相阻撓。再好的棋手都會被一些意外將了軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，也不差。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ep03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至少，之後的事情......還算值得期待，呵呵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","aliases":["W"]}]}
